[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-06T16:51:19-07:00","id":1543227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543216#post1543216\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could just choose any minor and major path that you like. <i>Voila</i>. I guess that\u2019s technically home-brew, but just barely. I\u2019m not against a hunter sourcebook, I think it\u2019s a cool idea. I\u2019m just saying that it isn\u2019t strictly needed.<br /> <br /> On a slightly related topic, I wonder if there will be any kind of mechanism for true faith or something similar?</div> </div> </div> </div>If the answer to &quot;how do I do X&quot; is &quot;homebrew it&quot; a separate book is needed if you ever want X to be a thing. If people wanted to hear &quot;homebrew it&quot; they wouldn't buy RPG books to begin with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-06T16:51:49-07:00","id":1543228,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543217#post1543217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> God, I hope not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Amen. <br /> <br /> ... I'm leaving now. Lol","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-06T22:17:19-07:00","id":1543251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543227#post1543227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If the answer to &quot;how do I do X&quot; is &quot;homebrew it&quot; a separate book is needed if you ever want X to be a thing. If people wanted to hear &quot;homebrew it&quot; they wouldn't buy RPG books to begin with.</div> </div> </div> </div>There doesn\u2019t really need to be another book to solve a problem that can be fixed with one quickly thought up sentence. <br /> <br /> Of course, a hunter book could have a bunch of cool stuff in it that goes far beyond how many attributes human characters get.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543217#post1543217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> God, I hope not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why is that? I always thought that the faith mechanic was one of the cooler abilities that hunters got.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-06T23:56:38-07:00","id":1543253,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543251#post1543251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why is that? I always thought that the faith mechanic was one of the cooler abilities that hunters got.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>On the Curseborne specific front, having faith of any kind be a mechanically impacting thing in a world where the main metaphysic is based on curses strikes me as non-sequitorial and wildly out of place. Even if you express the idea of faith as the origin of curses by exercising belief to maledict others, it feels like it's running against itself in a way that doesn't get productive.<br /> <br /> On the personal front, asides from having a scale of minimally useful to completely busted that always rubbed me wrong as a designer, I also just don't like the concept, from it's superficial religious/spiritual initial reading almost right down to reason I prefer Chronicles' more objective take on reality versus World's more subjective take. As much as <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h2Vx9qoLzFs\" target=\"_blank\">there are things that we do have to take on faith</a>, faith simply as a virtue feels like exacerbating an idea to a point of damage, nevermind faith as any kind of metaphysic. That's just my taste, though-I like when perception's effect on reality is limited to the wave-particle collapse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-07-2024, 02:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T04:56:53-07:00","id":1543258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543251#post1543251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There doesn\u2019t really need to be another book to solve a problem that can be fixed with one quickly thought up sentence.<br /> <br /> Of course, a hunter book could have a bunch of cool stuff in it that goes far beyond how many attributes human characters get.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, you don't want there to be another book, &quot;give them a family and lineage despite them not having either of those things&quot; is really bad homebrew that may work mechanically but it totally goes in contrast to all the themes and feel of the work. Otherwise you would be able to answer how to make a human with RAW. <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T16:06:26-07:00","id":1543294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543251#post1543251\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There doesn\u2019t really need to be another book to solve a problem that can be fixed with one quickly thought up sentence.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>No, but there may be a book that solves this problem and does a lot of other things.<br /> <br /> By itself, a book on Hunters that's well written isn't a bad thing, regardless of any problem they exist primarily to tackle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T16:30:11-07:00","id":1543296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543294#post1543294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No, but there may be a book that solves this problem and does a lot of other things.<br /> <br /> By itself, a book on Hunters that's well written isn't a bad thing, regardless of any problem they exist primarily to tackle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yeah, I support the idea of a hunter supplement book in the future. I just don\u2019t care that much if the core book doesn\u2019t make any accommodations for hunter style characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T16:40:09-07:00","id":1543297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sergeant Brother</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543296#post1543296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh yeah, I support the idea of a hunter supplement book in the future. I just don\u2019t care that much if the core book doesn\u2019t make any accommodations for hunter style characters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Here I agree 110%. I want pages in the core book devoted to the accursed. I think Hunter is a fine supplement but not more than that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-07T18:35:48-07:00","id":1543307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ShadowcatX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/curseborne/1543052-curseborne-supplement-idea-\u2013-mortal-hunters?p=1543297#post1543297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here I agree 110%. I want pages in the core book devoted to the accursed. I think Hunter is a fine supplement but not more than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the thing with a new game like this, especially following the WoD and CoD, is that they can only focus on so much in a core book. Those other settings were fleshed out over the course of years with numerous books. The main Curseborn book will necessarily be limited in some ways. That\u2019s alright though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}